WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:02.200
Though it's unorthodox

00:02.560 --> 00:03.800
But

00:03.880 --> 00:05.480
I know quite a bit of medicine

00:05.560 --> 00:07.440
Anyone under grandfather with injuries or illness

00:07.520 --> 00:09.320
I handle them all

00:19.320 --> 00:20.720
Tonight

00:20.840 --> 00:23.160
The Wunu camp is brightly lit

00:23.240 --> 00:25.040
They must be planning strategy

00:25.120 --> 00:28.320
I'm afraid they'll launch a major attack tomorrow

00:31.880 --> 00:33.280
Aren't you afraid?

00:34.800 --> 00:36.800
Xuan people in the north

00:37.000 --> 00:39.000
What is there to fear?

00:39.440 --> 00:40.840
Perhaps

00:41.160 --> 00:42.280
The only fear

00:42.360 --> 00:43.760
Is that one day

00:43.880 --> 00:46.960
We no longer believe we are Xuan people

